        <!--
        ================================================================
        TestNG Suite Configuration
        ================================================================

        Purpose:
        Controls TestNG execution behavior.

        Responsibilities:
        1. Configure parallel execution.
        2. Configure thread count.
        3. Define execution suite.
        4. Trigger Runner classes.

        Execution Flow:
        GitHub Actions / Jenkins
                  ↓
               Maven
                  ↓
              testng.xml
                  ↓
         ParallelTestNgTestRunner
                  ↓
             Feature Files

        Key Settings:
        parallel="methods"
            Executes methods/scenarios in parallel.

        thread-count="8"
            Maximum 8 concurrent threads.

        preserve-order="false"
            Allows TestNG to optimize execution order.

        Note:
        testng.xml controls HOW tests execute.
        Runner class controls WHAT tests execute.

        ================================================================
        -->